{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"满射"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"slug":[{"Plain":"满射(范畴论)"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>称某范畴中的态射 $f\\colon X\\to Y$ 为<strong>满射</strong>是指对任意对象 $Z$, 映射\n$$\r\nf^*\\colon \\operatorname{Hom}(Y,Z) \\to \\operatorname{Hom}(X,Z)\r\n$$\n为"},{"Local":{"url":"单射","text":"单射"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}